        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Yoshua alongenye inko shonse isha bena Israeli ku Shekemu. Aitile abakalamba, intungulushi, bakapingula ba mulandu elyo na bacilolo ba bena Israeli no kwisa ituula abene ku cinso cakwa Lesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.11.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Icite 11:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awe Yoshua aeba abantu bonse ati, “Ifi efyo Yawe, Lesa wa bena Israeli, asosa ati, ‘Ukufumafye kale na kale, ifikolwe fyenu, ukubikakofye na Tera wishi wakwa Abrahamu na Naho, baikele kwishilya lya mumana wa Yufurate, kabili fyalepepa imilungu imbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.12.1+GEN.12.2+GEN.12.3+GEN.12.4+GEN.12.5+GEN.12.6+GEN.12.7+GEN.12.8+GEN.12.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Icite 12:1-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.21.1+GEN.21.2+GEN.21.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "21:1-3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo ine nabuulile shinwe Abrahamu, namufumya kwishilya lya mumana wa Yufurate no kumutungulula monse mu calo ca Kenani no kumupeela ulupwa ulwingi. Namupeela no mwana Isaki, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.25.24+GEN.25.25+GEN.25.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Icite 25:24-26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.36.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "36:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.46.1+GEN.46.2+GEN.46.3+GEN.46.4+GEN.46.5+GEN.46.6+GEN.46.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "46:1-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.2.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Amaf 2:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Isaki nao namupeele abana bakwe Yakobo na Esau. Kabili napeele Esau icalo ca mpili ica Seiri, lelo Yakobo wena na bana baume bakwe baile ku calo ca Egupto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Ukuf 3:1—12:42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo natumine Mose na Aroni no kucusha abena Egupto ku finkunka ifyo nacitile mulya, na panuma nalimufumishemo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.14.1+EXO.14.2+EXO.14.3+EXO.14.4+EXO.14.5+EXO.14.6+EXO.14.7+EXO.14.8+EXO.14.9+EXO.14.10+EXO.14.11+EXO.14.12+EXO.14.13+EXO.14.14+EXO.14.15+EXO.14.16+EXO.14.17+EXO.14.18+EXO.14.19+EXO.14.20+EXO.14.21+EXO.14.22+EXO.14.23+EXO.14.24+EXO.14.25+EXO.14.26+EXO.14.27+EXO.14.28+EXO.14.29+EXO.14.30+EXO.14.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ukuf 14:1-31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo nafumishe ifikolwe fyenu mu Egupto, mwaishile kuli bemba. Abena Egupto basupile abafyashi benu na maceleta yabo, pamo na bali pali bakabalwe no kuya bafisha kuli Bemba Wakashika",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24:6",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Bemba Wakashika:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ba Baibele bamo batila, “bemba wa matete.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo bakuutile kuli Yawe pakuti abafwe, Yawe abikile imfifi pakati kenu elyo na bena Egupto. Elyo aletele amenshi pali bene no kubebisha. Kabili imwe mwaliimwenene na menso yenu ifyo nacitile ku bena Egupto. Na imwe mwaikele mu matololo pa nshita ikalamba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
