              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Imili 7:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nomba amafupa yakwa Yosefu, ayo abena Israeli bafumishe ku Egupto, bayashiikile ku Shekemu mu mpanga iyo Yakobo ashitile ukulingana ne ndalama umwanda umo isha silifa, ukufuma kuli bamwana Hamori, wishi wakwa Shekemu. Ici nomba cali e cakaniko ca cishilano ca lupwa lwakwa Yosefu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.24.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.24.32"
            ]
